#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD2020 expect=skipped domain=DM
#note "DM deliberately carries no AGETXT column. Requirements.Variables.All is [AGETXT]; the column is absent, so the rule SKIPS. AGETXT is not an SDTMIG DM variable at all, so this is the SDTMIG-conformant, normal shape (SD2020-F1), not a corner case -- do not soften to noViolation."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DM class="SPECIAL PURPOSE" label="Demographics"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col AGE     type=Num  label="Age"
col AGEU    type=Char label="Age Units"
---
S1 | DM | 001 | 45 | YEARS
S1 | DM | 002 | 52 | YEARS
